    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap",
      "knows": "relation"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-010",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "{He} always looks like {he}’s late for something, and usually is.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap",
      "knows": "relation"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-011",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t keep track of {him} beyond that. I’ve got my own troubles.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain",
      "knows": "relation"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-012",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s the whole of what I know about {him}, and it’s more than I wanted to.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap",
      "knows": "relation"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-013",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t go out of my way to watch people. I just notice them.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-014",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I wasn’t watching for anybody in particular.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-015",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t keep a clock on people. I just notice.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-016",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve got better things to do than keep count of people. Not tonight, but most nights.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-017",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People think nobody sees them. Somebody always does, and usually it’s me.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-018",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I mind my own business, mostly.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-019",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Make of it what you like.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-020",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s what I saw. What it means is your end of it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-021",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "And I know most people around here. The rest I know about.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-022",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "If I knew {him}, I’d tell you. I tell people everything. It’s a failing.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-023",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You meet a lot of people in a night. You don’t meet everybody.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-024",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Sorry. I’d help you if I could.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-025",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Names come and go around here.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-026",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Some nights I could count them on one hand.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-027",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s not a busy place, whatever anybody tells you.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-028",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I keep count. It’s a habit, like biting your nails.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-029",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Counting people is the easy part of the night.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-030",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I could give you those numbers in my sleep.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-031",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t miss many.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-032",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I count. I don’t ask.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-033",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Numbers I can give you.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-034",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Half the people through here I wouldn’t know again, and the other half I’d rather not.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-035",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People around here don’t stop to be known, and I don’t ask.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-036",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "A stranger’s a stranger. You can’t make friends with everybody. I’ve tried.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-037",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Half the people who come through here are on their way somewhere else.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-038",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I didn’t think a thing of it at the time.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-039",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Faces. That’s all most people are to me.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-040",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t ask.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-041",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You could set a clock by it, and people do.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-042",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s about the only thing around here that’s on time.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-043",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Everybody around here goes by it, whether they mean to or not.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-044",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’m sure of that much.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-045",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Ask anybody.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-046",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Nobody who was there could have missed it. I didn’t, and I miss plenty.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-047",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People talked about nothing else for an hour.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-048",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It was the kind of thing people talk about the next day.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-049",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t go in for talk.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-050",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Not much of a night, when you say it out loud.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-051",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve had better evenings. I’ve had worse. Not many.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-052",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You’d think I’d have more to show for it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-053",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I didn’t expect anybody to ask about it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-054",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s not much, but it’s mine.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-055",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all you get.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-056",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Write it down if you like.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-057",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t say it to make trouble. I say it because it’s so.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-058",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People talk. I listen. It isn’t a crime.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-059",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I could tell you more about this street than the street would like.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-060",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’d rather not have known it, if you want the truth.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-061",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Some things you hear whether you want to or not.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-062",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all I’ll say about it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-063",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You didn’t hear it from me.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-064",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’m not one for guessing, so that’s where it stops.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-065",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s the truth, for what it’s worth.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-066",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I can’t see why anybody would lie about a thing like that.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-067",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "There. Now you know as much as I do, and I feel lighter.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-068",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve said more than I meant to.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e001",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People think a street at night is empty. It never is.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e002",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I notice more than people think I do.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e003",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You’d be surprised what a person sees just standing still.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e004",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t miss much. Some nights I wish I did.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e005",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Somebody’s always going somewhere at this hour.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e006",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I just tell it the way it was. What you do with it is up to you.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e007",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’m not trying to get anybody in trouble.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e008",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I only know what went past me.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e009",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s as much as I’ve got.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e010",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve said it. I won’t say it twice.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e011",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Some nights you could fire a cannon through here and not hit anybody.",
    "joke": true,
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e012",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s about the same most nights, give or take.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-e013",
    "deck": "tail",
